5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Since our current habit isn't working, we need a system based on actual data. I want to make sure the workload is fair and realistic before we commit to anything for the whole year.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I totally agree! It's been feeling a bit off lately, hasn't it? Let's figure out what's actually happening so we can make a plan that makes everyone happy!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree that we need a sustainable system. To avoid future friction, I think it's important to understand our different expectations of what ""clean"" actually means. Let's be thorough so we can all stay on good terms.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I'm ready for a cleaning adventure! But we should check the money stuff too, right? I want to know exactly how much we're spending on things like sponges and bleach so it's fair for everyone!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. I just want to know what to expect when I walk into a room. It would be nice if it was always the same.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I'll look into the stopwatch timing of a full pass and the standard terms of the outside firm. I want to know the actual time commitment versus professional options.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,I'll check the absences on the wall calendar and a fortnight's watch on kitchen use! I want to see who's actually around and using the space the most before we decide.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I will look into what each housemate counts as done and the rows recorded in the house chat. I want to understand where our misunderstandings lie and what has caused tension in the past.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I'll check the bathroom spray stock and the tin's receipts! Also, the management office rate sheet and billing. I want to see where all the money is going!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... look into the bathroom grout after the July scrub and the note left by the previous tenants. Maybe they had a system that actually worked for them...,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I think we've covered the main bases. By comparing the actual time it takes to clean with the cost of a professional service, we can decide if the labor is worth the saving.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,"That sounds like a great plan, Ryuji! I'm really curious to see if the usage patterns match up with who's doing the work. It'll be so much easier to be fair once we have the facts!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"I hope that by reviewing our past conflicts and differing standards, we can address the root causes of our friction. It is better to be honest about our expectations now than to let resentment build up.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I hope we find out who's been paying for all the soap! It's like a treasure hunt for receipts! I can't wait to see if we're spending too much or just forgetting to pay each other back!,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... hope the previous tenants had some good advice. I just want things to be consistent... so I don't have to worry so much.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"Let's wait for the results. Once we have the data on timing, costs, and usage, we can evaluate the options logically and choose the most sustainable arrangement for the year.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm so excited to see what we find! Let's all be honest with our results so we can make the best system ever. I can't wait for the next round!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"I agree. Let's be mindful of how we share our findings. If we approach this with empathy and a desire for harmony, I'm sure we can find a solution that works for everyone.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm all set! I'll be the money detective! Let's see if we can solve the mystery of the missing payments and make everything super fair for everyone. I'm ready for the results!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... wait for the results too. I hope we can find a way to make everything feel stable. I'm looking forward to hearing what you all find.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
